      "kind": "markdown",
      "title": "个人主页搭建 Day1",
      "excerpt": "Day1. 基本UI风格确认",
      "date": "2026-10-24",
      "category": "9f3a861e-5bb3-4c56-a394-9777c065ef6e",
      "tags": [],
      "visibility": "public",
      "state": "published",
      "thumbnail": {
        "mode": "image",
